Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Analysis", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97418479958456*^9, 
  3.974184801173422*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a35cf283-b3a1-4b27-8fe2-\
6ed2577fc0e5"],

Cell["\<\
We can do the usual analysis of this system, which will start out by finding \
fixed points.
Note these are all stationary (velocities zero) as you might expect, so zero \
kinetic energy.
We can evaluate the potential energy at each point too and see a ladder of \
equally spaced energies.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974184805026578*^9, 3.974184825808923*^9}, {
  3.9741852405029087`*^9, 3.9741853043051443`*^9}, {3.9741870078458643`*^9, 
